  "description": "YIGJAA crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P -4 21 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H132 O12 Pr4,C7 H8. From the CIF bond table, Pr1 (Pr) has 5 O neighbors; Pr1C (Pr) has 5 O neighbors; Pr1A (Pr) has 5 O neighbors; Pr1B (Pr) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.781-3.781 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.58-106.45°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C60H132O12Pr4·C7H8.",
